  ('1af645604ae9f52303ce0503c916ec2279ca5bbcf4ec550756595d52e09d4878', 'ようがない is the noun 様 again: there is no way in which it could be done.', '[{"t":"ようがない"},{"t":" is the noun "},{"t":"様","r":"さま"},{"t":" again: there is no way in which it could be done."}]'::jsonb),
  ('660d02e926bda9266c09b9be06590c545d56d7ba0d586c3bca59557ec4394eed', 'The same 様 that gives ようだ and ように. ようがない says no manner of doing it exists at all.

