  ('3fb3d03d008ce576d27320ff222906a81ac655454412da7c6a9a74d0ec7d1be5', '故 is the kanji assigned to it; the こ of 事故 is that character''s unrelated Chinese reading. It is an ordinary noun, which is why it takes の after another noun: 病気ゆえに, 貧しさの故に.

