  ('5a61bd709d2b17ac6b632ee2173310e7f0fb5b20bfeda1362d02dbc1faecf583', '食べれる is usually described as sloppy, and prescriptively it still is. Historically it is the same change that produced 書ける, arriving late for the verbs it skipped.

