  ('b258f1036da7792a5789ff8938a38e45dc7431a9df086836294f980b790bb9f9', 'が began as a genitive "of", became a subject marker, and also came to join clauses. All three are alive: 我が国 is the oldest, 雨が降る the commonest, 高いが買う this one.

