  ('f166a4340a87f4f3232f132df79dcc7b52b0b95503f08cfb24f6fc145eb79c7f', 'Where と pairs exhaustively, や names examples and leaves the rest unsaid. 本や雑誌 is books, magazines, and whatever else.

