  ('8c6e20c549fbd2803f1b13480729c6a102751d286221090d8e4f26452781d788', 'ため is the noun 為, "benefit, sake, account".', '[{"t":"ため"},{"t":" is the noun "},{"t":"為","r":"す"},{"t":", \"benefit, sake, account\"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('b5a831913236d543aa429df77caa72dfe82cc44fe4db1065cbb9e27c557227a9', 'A plain noun, still written 為 in careful prose. 家族のために働く is "work for the family''s sake" with no idiom in it anywhere.

