  ('3cd9782fd6654a540a09cd766e889ac543e1f5396cb9f1d287edd0e1f0ee1886', 'They are 今日は and 今晩は ("as for today", "as for this evening") with the rest dropped. The full form ran on to ask after the person''s day.

