  ('2c3f91a7f5575986d09ea7d3d550e36471fb64a7cb7afde7c7c1660fd4b1186c', 'かねる means to be unable to bring oneself to do something: 分かりかねます, "I am not in a position to know". Negate it and you get "it is not that this could not happen".

