  ('c6023800820137acd5373f2f34e56aa32736fe96ec95fefde9bbb7892ccded8c', 'こso singles one thing out as the one that counts, and in classical Japanese it forced a particular ending on the sentence: 係り結び. Attached to a condition, it insists that this and no other is the reason.

