  ('44a830d75b7c284d700d9c7b02bec6dfb5ebb6a4203ea42ba212260ecf8d395e', 'こと is a real noun meaning a fact or an affair, and it makes a clause into one of those. の is the nominalising particle, and what it makes is nearer to hand.

