  ('b69279c313dca383aa479dfdc712c4f73fa1228f5a4f5fb41e3a5b0233118a8d', 'せる／させる makes someone do it; れる／られる then makes them the one it was done to. 食べさせられた parses as "was made to eat", each piece doing its own job.

