  ('aef256fa928d6d85d44c0ae1a6ea1461132e14e010baf7d181543580a72b0d41', 'たり, itself て + あり, had a full set of forms, and たら is its 未然形. So 〜たら is not the past tense plus a conditional; both た and たら descend from the one auxiliary.

