  ('5cae2b90c8431bab642f0c1ed1086d5021154c0646b10274355e087f6e2aa699', 'ないで is the negative with で: 傘を持たないで出かけた, going out in the circumstance of not having one. なくて is the adjective negative ない in its て-form, which links a cause: 分からなくて困った.

