  ('3efba9b9a8d858c9dd54cfd74bba0eb336a59b59a254f845f4e61fe9dbaefb3f', 'なくて is ない in its te-form, the same shape as 寒くて. ても adds "even", and いい judges it fine. Nothing is idiomatic: "even not doing it, it is good".

