  ('d0c92b516a9d964fc003952fe6dee689e59d2422b75fbb17850d884bac7b6281', 'なら is the 未然形 of the old copula なり, which was に plus あり.', '[{"t":"なら"},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"未","r":"ま"},{"t":"然"},{"t":"形","r":"なり"},{"t":" of the old copula "},{"t":"なり"},{"t":", which was "},{"t":"に"},{"t":" plus "},{"t":"あり"},{"t":"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('b315029ed0abe26a6bcb488594e3334d3fb71c7f5582f0b8ecbe2c634e895c2a', 'なり asserted that something was so, and its 未然形 なら took ば, later dropped, to give a plain hypothetical: "if it be so".

