  ('73838b89347b6bfda51ee54407437ddcb26eb205cbdd05b958ce944e96efbc0a', 'ようになる is 様 plus なる: coming to be the way where something happens.', '[{"t":"ようになる"},{"t":" is "},{"t":"様","r":"さま"},{"t":" plus "},{"t":"なる"},{"t":": coming to be the way where something happens."}]'::jsonb),
  ('a16fdfca60c9162ad1e7589d61be23e0aa1060d35b84badad4eb6ce353a826f0', 'なる is change of state, 様 is the way a thing is. Put together they describe arriving at a condition rather than performing an act.

