  ('20a2ed2ca1d4a84631f44656fec21d00a629d890da42ae3f31833a52f4772673', 'なる is the verb of becoming. Respect in Japanese works by not pointing directly at what the honoured person did, and putting their action inside なる is one way of looking away from it.

