  ('18fbdf8af433fef9daa746a44ef6043b1a7a1d6c4feb5a8baa7428291964169b', 'にかかわらず and にもかかわらず share every other syllable. も means "even", and adding it says that even this (which plainly should have been concerned in the matter) was not.

