  ('39616bdfba6957691486b57ecf531701ffc9adba70d1c5457bdc9cf5b2e6a668', 'は marks the topic of a whole sentence, and a clause describing a noun is not a whole sentence. So 私が買った本 uses が, and 私は buys nothing inside a clause.

