  ('4fa72f5c1f379194b713d50d42db231ed5299fb1ba060ea2bcbeb810c3c08daa', 'へ began as 辺 (he), a noun meaning the area around something: a shore, a border, a general vicinity. "Go to the vicinity of Tokyo" became, over time, simply "go toward Tokyo".

