  ('b37afad027fcdfe2b1bbfde3adbdbda52cba0849a79e285a1a8d1692ed7adb1c', '何も is the question word swept up by も, and the negative is what turns it into "nothing".', '[{"t":"何","r":"なに"},{"t":"も"},{"t":" is the question word swept up by "},{"t":"も"},{"t":", and the negative is what turns it into \"nothing\"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('11b78301e668d94685e1121974d49942b4a8b9006c48720679b4e032408d6007', 'も adds everything in, so 何も takes all the possible whats at once. Follow it with a negative and every one of them is ruled out.

