  ('e46527a366baf10e2722561f4869319c7cb5355b91080cbbad94aaf792638aaf', 'ません ends in the fossilised negative ん, which does not inflect. So the polite negative past cannot be built the way ました is; it borrows でした, the past of です, and puts it after.

