  ('d8d75627cf82689a0f6c93a82bbab4931b7773bcd9958e679f0119f71d85d379', 'まだ says the change has not come (まだ食べていません), and もう says it has: もう食べました. They are not opposites of degree but of whether a threshold has been crossed.

