  ('e2803ad5698ba302988d056f12e7dd14f1a2455693cf9813b072c655fd0f8a28', 'わけがない flatly denies that any reason exists. わけではない uses では (the topic-marked negative), and topic-marking is what makes it partial: it denies this particular account while leaving others standing.

