  ('e1ee71a4619c4b1886d8f25917a286ffad6a066c3d140f711f32da6bbea51441', '三人 is さんにん, borrowed Chinese number plus borrowed reading, entirely regular. 一人 and 二人 are ひと and ふた (the native numbers behind ひとつ and ふたつ), with a native ending.

