  ('734e673a50db6bfa49c76c2cb5c29a577274e05fd578be2cfff0c9c5e696c70f', '全然 means "wholly, entirely", and in Meiji writing (Sōseki among others), it modifies positives freely. The rule tying it to negatives is younger than the word.

