  ('97c4aca7a7fcaa6374b088649d9eeb26a2bbe69f2469e9fb1e3eb5d766579ccf', '友達と行く pairs you with a companion exactly as 本と鉛筆 pairs two things. Nothing distinguishes them but what is on either side.

