  ('93ea9897c7035d1f95ff2cf458c757bdff4d12d91fe6c9258007b764ca34bd5a', '向ける is to aim something; 向く is to face. 子供向け is aimed at children by whoever made it; 子供向き is suited to children by its own nature.

