  ('4d04bb0602df30af74bafbcbbaaf13008702fb32ea8b6ae1195e138a44f2ffc9', '塗 is a shared spelling, not shared ancestry: まみれる is not kin to 塗る. It is attested from the Heian period, in 大和物語 among others.

