  ('a984f018721b352455e7cff7d96f988ea5f084aa80c8fc7427a2a7a37390bf9b', '始める, 終わる and 続ける are full verbs. Attached to a stem they say when the action starts, stops or carries on, and nothing is idiomatic about the join.

