  ('f9f522ec15aff7db53b6ee1172dfbc58f61a70bfb9aa81b1773dd6f27998ecb1', '所 is an ordinary noun. 出かけるところ is the spot just before leaving, 出かけているところ the spot during, 出かけたところ the spot immediately after.

