  ('68d712632a7f2302fec7ba457f948887bf36b494031cd6d8efc62d97cacfdf91', '敵ながらあっぱれ, 残念ながら, 知りながら黙っていた: none of these needs a も, and all of them concede. The concession is ながら''s own, inherited from its older sense of a state persisting unchanged, the one preserved in 昔ながら and 生まれながらに.

