  ('c71b017b6cacc8cecf328ff4302fc1be6c52ba0757a652bc91e9a703d655d4e2', '見える is "to be visible, to appear": intransitive, so what appears takes が. The 様 supplies the manner, and the whole says something presents the appearance of being so.

