  ('cdea4bb25591644ef19bd448021fc9d1558006abe6e937ca9b4aefbcdaaaec4b', '田中という人 is "a person one says 田中 of". The naming use is the plain literal reading, and it is why the thing named goes in front with no particle of its own.

