  ('35cb9e4981bae9d779a41af72d5bbe4d4b229b3d9f9aca4520acc410fbe7a5f8', 'The か that makes a question is the same か that turns 誰 into "someone".', '[{"t":"The "},{"t":"か"},{"t":" that makes a question is the same "},{"t":"か"},{"t":" that turns "},{"t":"誰","r":"だれ"},{"t":" into \"someone\"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('708def1b2e04b745df47d254d481885cffd45a99fd131be4de410de7c671d608', '誰か is literally "who?" left standing, the question mark folded into the word, so it names the answer without knowing it.

