  ('fbf356ae8a8ad2e9ef19d361342e9fb2d013cb0551a0db1b8306d4f37f537166', '関わる is an everyday verb: 事件に関わる, to be mixed up in something. にかかわらず says the outcome is not concerned with the thing named.

