  ('2a8ad70f5f9e586b68e6d3cea7457ffc016c3771203afa7bb66d794ef23b9205', '降るそうだ takes the plain form whole (tense, negation and all), because what is being passed on is somebody else''s statement, and a statement needs all of it.

