  ('c3d9dc6ea9c4608ad16385b5153d7335ff88b803a10bc1e8a49080d0488a8758', '後 is an ordinary noun for what lies behind, and で marks where matters stand.', '[{"t":"後","r":"あと"},{"t":" is an ordinary noun for what lies behind, and "},{"t":"で"},{"t":" marks where matters stand."}]'::jsonb),
  ('cbe9d1dfc25902eb3598ce5997b4fad4a66dee6ff1c2eee89fdab8a8a86ec809', '駅の後ろ uses the same character for physical behind. 後で puts the sentence at a point after the thing named, a position noun with the で of circumstance.

