  ('88090371fa9eb28bfa47ef82262360dc9c027b97d590cadf084a6989abe74e43', 'The に of 週に三回 is the same に that marks a point: it names the frame the count sits in.', '[{"t":"The "},{"t":"に"},{"t":" of "},{"t":"週","r":"しゅう"},{"t":"に"},{"t":"三","r":"さん"},{"t":"回","r":"まわ"},{"t":" is the same "},{"t":"に"},{"t":" that marks a point: it names the frame the count sits in."}]'::jsonb),
  ('28e5e789ae0a051c52a543df174376116bc4f60113a37635071bbda77b4cfe7d', '週に三回 sets "week" as the unit and puts three occurrences inside it. に is doing what it always does: naming the place something lands.

