  ('5a7ce889e47c4b68b3372122cebd4a4435730ea9f61fecfd8771e5ac66acda19', '否 is the classical word for no, the same one in か否か at N2. Asking whether a thing has happened or not, at the instant of asking, gives the sense of immediacy.

