  ('163829375de25b8c76af25233d4b5a6faea368338a1bcea8dc33ec4ffdbc83d5', 'ている is the te-form with いる, "exists having done". Whether that reads as in-progress, as a resulting state, or as a habit is decided by the verb''s own aspect and by adverbs like 毎日.

