  ('fbd60091ded5803b15c297cf2ef110770d78a95b82c32591ba159de5b5379348', 'ごろ is 頃, a noun meaning a time or a season, a point, not a quantity.', '[{"t":"ごろ"},{"t":" is "},{"t":"頃","r":"ごろ"},{"t":", a noun meaning a time or a season, a point, not a quantity."}]'::jsonb),
  ('bd85079fd675576d3f92a568d2030f51757b710df7b0c0fccc2e1af697e9ba87', '若い頃 is one''s youth; 三時ごろ is around three. What ごろ makes vague is where a moment falls.

