  ('8c1c5a22d16ce5bd79350162d4ec3294e1850a39d0d0b8836c19d7d04acc9b74', 'The potential negative of 行く, used exactly as English uses "that won''t do". 食べてはいけません says that eating, as a proposition, does not go anywhere.

