  ('94f9e7bf31b9ecfc5b85d4d1fbe419fdebaf8e23fd08cfb73e0bfc4a65a79265', 'から gives a cause; と言って quotes it as something asserted. Quoting a reason rather than stating it is what marks it as somebody else''s inference.

