  ('b88aa0edf3636436da341652aadd37773553d712fc0220baa600cd552e21b143', 'Classical adjectives had a form used before verbs, and for い-adjectives it was く. For な-adjectives, which are nouns with a copula, it is に, the copula''s own connecting form.

