  ('785be54929c1d32015cb4464f32aad26b03d1726ede6ffecd3881668c5b91ac5', 'もと is 元 or 基, the source or the material a thing is made from.', '[{"t":"もと"},{"t":" is "},{"t":"元","r":"ゆあん"},{"t":" or "},{"t":"基","r":"き"},{"t":", the source or the material a thing is made from."}]'::jsonb),
  ('5d5934d78fa7cdc524f0a751a8e9df54aa5514e43b9736858b72e9d2ef8dee49', 'Nearly the same word as 基づく, used differently. をもとに supplies raw material: 実話をもとにした映画 is a film made out of a true story.

