  ('d28230c7c85d88f112eb7a6e8dbec7b3c2f651530f48613e759739636bed3d67', 'たい continues the Old Japanese auxiliary adjective たし. It was an adjective from the start, so 食べたい is grammatically an adjective phrase, not a verb.

