  ('9ec28a87ddb8d5629e84f3823d6a3ea660eba863089500dc2b46340ea037ed46', 'ほか is 外: outside. There is nothing outside this option.', '[{"t":"ほか"},{"t":" is "},{"t":"外","r":"がい"},{"t":": outside. There is nothing outside this option."}]'::jsonb),
  ('ca4b5c5441e4546c2cc87f1597f571749a428e1b54042164cc95578a3f0963a7', 'より marks comparison, 外 is the outside of a thing. 諦めるよりほかない says that beyond giving up there is nothing.

