  ('859c091f81a2239a577d0b48f55f0d12cb5d2c71cac09c69252a7f44329ef11d', 'ほかならない is 他 with the classical copula なり negated: "is not anything other".', '[{"t":"ほかならない"},{"t":" is "},{"t":"他","r":"ほか"},{"t":" with the classical copula "},{"t":"なり"},{"t":" negated: \"is not anything other\"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('3491288c11dba0bf4080dc2da96e27e200b93ecefb953d0197e83727c3692ac1', 'The なら is the 未然形 of the copula なり, not the verb なる. Classical ほかならず said outright "is nothing other than", which is exactly the modern meaning; nothing has shifted.

