  ('70a32a913d9b861d601ca1b1e2b095e7c25d9c4ed24f10fc5b50691fc24a0d66', 'みる is 見る, "to look": do it and see what happens.', '[{"t":"みる"},{"t":" is "},{"t":"見","r":"み"},{"t":"る"},{"t":", \"to look\": do it and see what happens."}]'::jsonb),
  ('5c365849d828760f945c443ea48ad0bd24204bc718fe190cb55807a15d6a0093', 'Written in kana rather than as 見る precisely because it has stopped being about the eyes, but the meaning is unchanged: perform the action and then look at the result.

