  ('b5ba8fbe5be43a3a13de71034a06f1314a76f0680e9615609c0d3151bfed992b', 'ものの is the noun 物 with の, the same 物 as ものだ.', '[{"t":"ものの"},{"t":" is the noun "},{"t":"物","r":"もの"},{"t":" with "},{"t":"の"},{"t":", the same "},{"t":"物","r":"もの"},{"t":" as "},{"t":"ものだ"},{"t":"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('94a562f05696374f97fc93ccd980a7fcce5bc8059ebe13cb3a98cffe9f2130bb', 'It names the situation as a thing and then modifies onward from it, and the concession comes from the mismatch that follows rather than from any word meaning "although".

