  ('2634e24e88c7932b2f73f6a124845ec48d0087596fdf5342541f78d9c0458519', '一方 is "one side": one of the two directions a thing can be looked at from.', '[{"t":"一方","r":"いっぽう"},{"t":" is \"one side\": one of the two directions a thing can be looked at from."}]'::jsonb),
  ('bb40d1a42b822a7a7e2eb81232d7a817175dc4551cfa1a12e6ba65296b215ade', '方 is the same 方 as ほうが and 〜方: a side or direction. 一方 names one of them and leaves the other implied.

