  ('ebb2c6a3785dc1c40d898383ecd106be80d6267e30af50262a475046e06f5730', '上 is "on top of", and doing something on top of another thing means doing it afterwards, on that footing.', '[{"t":"上","r":"うえ"},{"t":" is \"on top of\", and doing something on top of another thing means doing it afterwards, on that footing."}]'::jsonb),
  ('d0af2a22bc2a9e6346abb776bb91d99ae87e78fdc2e36433f468ade08e662efc', 'The plain noun for an upper surface. よく考えた上で is deciding while standing on the thinking already done.

