  ('fe1c708ea11df36367fef0acc5e984761593249ad39e0f593a3bc44b3d94f7be', '予定 is 予 ("beforehand") plus 定 ("fixed"), settled in advance.', '[{"t":"予定","r":"よてい"},{"t":" is "},{"t":"予","r":"かね"},{"t":" (\"beforehand\") plus "},{"t":"定","r":"さだ"},{"t":" (\"fixed\"), settled in advance."}]'::jsonb),
  ('f1bed9da5aced5f18bb981aa80d5a481abb93c8dc02bff211c19bc61901405e1', 'The same 予 as in 予約 and 予習. What makes 予定 different from つもり is in those characters: something has been fixed, by a timetable or by someone else, rather than intended by you.

