  ('1d0bc0e9270caac4a986abc53fd2fa8a96764673d1fa393fadf3e7d2c57a3e0c', '仕 is a kanji later fitted to the native stem し, the same fitting as 仕事 for しごと; the 方 is the one in 書き方 at N4. 仕方がない on its own is the everyday "nothing to be done".

