  ('edd04af2d08e50bef9d9fc8f47c9969487313f1e866cc292ae984e9ab36122d0', '伴う is native とも, the とも of 友 and お供, with the old verb-making なう.', '[{"t":"伴","r":"ともな"},{"t":"う"},{"t":" is native "},{"t":"とも"},{"t":", the "},{"t":"とも"},{"t":" of "},{"t":"友","r":"ゆう"},{"t":" and "},{"t":"お"},{"t":"供","r":"とも"},{"t":", with the old verb-making "},{"t":"なう"},{"t":"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('45bb90eba92fc9f7a6ea7dbaa0be4878f4019f6048e9e252c11bc31508ab4b5e', 'The same なう as in 損なう and 商う. 伴 is a kanji fitted to it afterwards; the ハン of 同伴 and 伴奏 is the unrelated Chinese reading of that character.

