  ('7c15caed8bbd8e43b7a7be707f5291c8410127cc0a5e3a13520718d3236ec3f9', '余儀 is "another way", and 余儀なく is having none.', '[{"t":"余","r":"あま"},{"t":"儀"},{"t":" is \"another way\", and "},{"t":"余","r":"あま"},{"t":"儀なく"},{"t":" is having none."}]'::jsonb),
  ('97fd7369d09cc9ae3288962c7adc17f9d1ec4058e3e650aac9142f84caa8a9d0', '余 is the 余 of 余る, what is left over; 儀 is a matter or a manner. 余儀 is the other course available, and 余儀ない says there is not one.

