  ('44c671c24d3a1f8abd9d86a88122ace3340a6e516827a2c5a7568fbbe86d2f4f', '反面 is literally "the opposite face": 反 as in 反対, 面 as a surface.', '[{"t":"反","r":"たん"},{"t":"面","r":"づら"},{"t":" is literally \"the opposite face\": "},{"t":"反","r":"たん"},{"t":" as in "},{"t":"反対","r":"はんたい"},{"t":", "},{"t":"面","r":"づら"},{"t":" as a surface."}]'::jsonb),
  ('68e68c998cc623d9b3122a61e41d962cb9cb845c5c31951dd92257ee1d465e11', 'A noun naming the other side of the same thing. That is what makes it different from 一方で.

