  ('43d8708e226377624d97a04795b83a06d9b3b684eddd4cc4cc1d67566efff930', '問わず is 問う, "to ask", with the classical negative ず: "without asking".', '[{"t":"問","r":"と"},{"t":"わず"},{"t":" is "},{"t":"問","r":"と"},{"t":"う"},{"t":", \"to ask\", with the classical negative "},{"t":"ず"},{"t":": \"without asking\"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('555d8f24d8953dbd4c559a50f53da2bc1233b1edd5152ad2c5edbebc98ba17df', '経験を問わず on a job advertisement says nobody will be asking about experience. The verb is the ordinary one in 問題 and 質問.

