  ('244220e1bfad34a68d85cc673ed23ed004119b8eef233fe1bed4c73d54825daf', '通じる is the Chinese loan 通 made into a verb, a different word from the native とおる.', '[{"t":"通","r":"つう"},{"t":"じる"},{"t":" is the Chinese loan "},{"t":"通","r":"とお"},{"t":" made into a verb, a different word from the native "},{"t":"とおる"},{"t":"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('6b02c60e8d43b7f84ade0630bdb5ff7d4f2eb65d92585858be714abdfc7c6fc1', '通ず, ツウ plus the ancestor of する. とおる and とおり share only the character with it, which is why the two belong to different registers.

