  ('3ae4d6c564d6521c26ac62272d73709670359047251b02c14fd898c9ec7a2732', '際 is an edge or a verge, the 際 of 国際 and 窓際.', '[{"t":"際","r":"きわ"},{"t":" is an edge or a verge, the "},{"t":"際","r":"きわ"},{"t":" of "},{"t":"国際","r":"こくさい"},{"t":" and "},{"t":"窓","r":"まど"},{"t":"際","r":"きわ"},{"t":"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('948864bec4e2d3343089d4f7d8b2b07de702ebc2cc816a7ad52a0cdc5a590798', 'A boundary line. に際して stands the sentence at the edge of an event, just as it begins.

