  ('9c9fefd77207e3b15643e85e2b5ca7301e552766f9f5c18ba19b74d20f82ee82', '難い is the かたい of がたい (the same word voiced), and here it is negated.', '[{"t":"難","r":"にく"},{"t":"い"},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"かたい"},{"t":" of "},{"t":"がたい"},{"t":" (the same word voiced), and here it is negated."}]'::jsonb),
  ('c4624098485cbae8ca9b2b3541e26c7d8f93ec6e2e5158caacc00af7080d53b6', 'がたい at N3 says hard to bring oneself to. かたくない says the opposite: not hard at all.

