  ('91b893252eece980bf83f73720867af75cfbea90cdaf6774c4987545d50dca1f', '願う is "to wish, to pray", the same 願 as in 願書 and お願い事.', '[{"t":"願","r":"ねが"},{"t":"う"},{"t":" is \"to wish, to pray\", the same "},{"t":"願","r":"ねが"},{"t":" as in "},{"t":"願書","r":"がんしょ"},{"t":" and "},{"t":"お"},{"t":"願","r":"ねが"},{"t":"い"},{"t":"事","r":"じ"},{"t":"."}]'::jsonb),
  ('f7c25ba5352a947fe7ef4932ea8a418e6dc5570490d04906782b1625d0c9b398', 'お願いします is the humble お〜する form of that verb: I respectfully do the wishing. The construction is the one taught at N4.

